\n三大重要要素\n• (一年目夏まで) 食料室のバンドル\n• ダンジョン用の補助アイテム\n• 保存ジャー\n次点\n• 魚のいる池による養殖\n• マホガニーの種の植林\n逆に重要そうで重要ではないもの\n• 伐採\n• 料理\n• 動物を撫でること\n• 天然の牧草\n• 製粉機","ts":"1637375344.094200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8T1uq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f031dba-7bbd-48f7-9ec4-4aa725af1fb8","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://store.steampowered.com/app/413150/Stardew_Valley/\u003e プレイ時間がじわじわのびてきていま140hに入った","ts":"1637375005.092600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Stardew Valley on Steam","id":1,"title":"Stardew Valley on Steam","title_link":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/413150/Stardew_Valley/","text":"You've inherited your grandfather's old farm plot in Stardew Valley. Armed with hand-me-down tools and a few coins, you set out to begin your new life. Can you learn to live off the land and turn these overgrown fields into a thriving home?","image_url":"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/413150/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1608624324","blocks":null,"service_name":"store.steampowered.com","from_url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/413150/Stardew_Valley/","original_url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/413150/Stardew_Valley/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DBpW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb989a4e-0cc9-47a9-8123-44879f1e3f5b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/shiren_spchun/status/1461654926627541000\u003e\nそう言えばまだクリアしてないところで止まってる…","ts":"1637339240.091900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/shiren_spchun|@shiren_spchun\u003e: Nintendo Switch版『風来のシレン5plus』が只今セール中！！\nダウンロード版を20%OFFの2,384 円(税込)で購入できます。気になっていた方は、11月29日までなのでお早めに！\n\u003chttps://store-jp.nintendo.com/list/software/70010000025959.html\u003e\n\n#不思議のダンジョン\n#風来のシレン","id":1,"author_name":"風来のシレン公式","author_subname":"@shiren_spchun","author_link":"https://twitter.com/shiren_spchun/status/146165